      "content": "Since the sensor data definitively proves no external damage occurred, denying the claim outright could trigger an angry escalations that are far more costly than a simple replacement. Offering a replacement is more efficient because it resolves the customer's core frustration about losing their vase without engaging in a potentially damaging dispute over who was at fault. Additionally, since we aren't paying for you to ship an item that was already broken upon arrival, this solution minimizes your direct financial loss while preserving future business opportunities.",
